@startuml
title RuleSphere - Activity Diagram\n08. Historical Explanation and Audit | UC-25..26
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFF0ED
skinparam activityBorderColor #496477
|Authorized User / Auditor|
start
:Request explanation by ExecutionID\nor audit inspection by filter;
|Evidence Query Service|
:Authenticate and authorize action within Tenant/Workspace;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return access error without disclosing evidence;
  stop
endif
if (Historical explanation requested?) then (yes)
  :Read scoped retained hot trace\nand compliance metadata;
  if (Full trace retained?) then (yes)
    :Include protected node, branch and outcome details;
  else (no)
    :Mark full trace unavailable;
  endif
  if (Accessible approval/release reference exists?) then (yes)
    :Read referenced evidence within authorized scope;
  endif
  :Assemble available execution, version\nand release evidence;
else (audit inspection)
  :Read scoped governance, deployment\nand security audit records;
endif
:Record attributable evidence-access audit event;
if (Requested evidence available?) then (yes)
  :Return protected evidence with retention limitations;
else (no)
  :Return explicit not-found / no-retained-evidence result;
endif
|Authorized User / Auditor|
:View explanation / audit records or authorized export;
stop
legend bottom
  Full trace may expire before compliance metadata.
  Return only retained evidence; never invent missing intermediate decisions.
  Queries and referenced evidence must remain within authorized scope.
endlegend
@enduml
